@startuml view-roadmap
!include include/palette.puml
skinparam wrapWidth 520
<style>
legend {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor #8A8A8A
  FontSize 12
}
activityDiagram {
  activity {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #8A8A8A
    FontSize 12
    RoundCorner 8
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #8A8A8A
    FontColor #555555
    FontSize 11
  }
  note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    LineColor #C9B458
    FontSize 11
  }
  .done {
    BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    LineColor $C_NONPROD_TIER
    LineThickness 2
  }
  .active {
    BackgroundColor #FFF4E0
    LineColor $C_WAKE
    LineThickness 2.5
  }
  .todo {
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
    LineColor $C_LEGACY
  }
  .optional {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor $C_LEGACY
    LineStyle 5-4
  }
}
</style>

title View: phased roadmap and its status on 2026-09-24 (§9; ADR-IR34 exit criteria)

start
:<b>P0 Design</b>   <color:$C_NONPROD_TIER><b>done</b></color>
----
• every file of §11 exists
• validations pass or are recorded as not run, Offline tests included
• Gitleaks clean; the user accepts or amends §10; <<done>>
:<b>P1 Platform provisioning and conformance</b>   <color:$C_WAKE><b>in progress</b></color>
----
<color:$C_NONPROD_TIER><b>done</b></color>  provisioning (P1-01, P1-02, P1-04 to P1-11): the foundation,
the build cluster and runner, the Codefresh and Octopus objects,
both app clusters; workorders and sandbox onboarded
<color:$C_NONPROD_TIER><b>done</b></color>  the end-to-end pass delivered a change to prod (P1-12)
<color:$C_WAKE><b>running</b></color>  the conformance suite (P1-13)
<b>pending</b>  the Owner re-run of P1-03 (R30) and the exit criteria:
• five green nightly runs and one green destructive run
• both app clusters asleep for 90 % of the nights
• spend within 1.2 times the §3.5 estimate
• app #1: 10 green master builds, each release created once,
  build within 1.2 times legacy, images verifiable with cosign; <<active>>
note left
  <b>Sleep and wake in P1</b>
  octopus/terraform creates platform-wake,
  Platform Automation, the step-scoped key,
  the env-sleep-hourly triggers, the machine policy;
  the first platform-wake release precedes app releases;
  both app clusters sleep from their first env-apply;
  the builds pool scales from zero;
  the suite is the drill: CAP-OCT-008 to 011,
