end note
split
  -> P1 exit;
  :<b>P2 TDD maturity for app #1</b>   <b>not started</b>
  ----
  Scope: tdd auto-deploy, WI-08, Kyverno Audit in nonprod
  • 20 or more consecutive TDD releases, at least 90 % green
  • median commit to verified TDD no worse than legacy
  • drills: failed migration, self-heal, redeploy under 15 min
  • platform/tdd reported (R16)
  • 14 days of Kyverno audit without a false deny; <<todo>>
  note left
    <b>Sleep and wake in P2</b>
    the nightly suite keeps proving it;
    the exit adds one manual check:
    a job that lands just after a sleep
  end note
  :<b>P3 UAT on AKS and the Worker</b>   <b>not started</b>
  ----
  • two UAT cycles approved in Octopus; UAT smoke blocking
  • the Worker 14 days in UAT with no queue growth
  • lead time in Insights; no floating image in workorders/release; <<todo>>
  :<b>P4 Prod cutover of app #1</b>   <b>not started</b>
  ----
  Scope: WI-01, 02, 03, 05; legacy data import; host move (R35)
  • the rehearsal succeeded; a restore drill within the RTO
  • 14 days of prod SLO within budget
  • rollback to the legacy path possible until P5; <<todo>>
  note left
